# A79 (our desktop, sd-base, no #Z): the C:\ window is open at boot. Park the
# pointer bottom-right (never through the menu bar -- A76 Nachtrag), dump the
# idle desktop, double-click the "C Hard disk" drive icon (35,38; outside the
# window, whose left edge is x=48) -> a second C:\ window opens staggered by
# (24,24) (kernel/src/desk/main.rs open_dir_window), park again, dump twice.
# Ticks are 200 Hz after "[desk] desktop up" (A46 dual arming).
200 parkbr
1100 mark A_IDLE
1400 move 35 38
1600 down
1603 up
1608 down
1611 up
2000 parkbr
2600 mark B_TWO_WINDOWS
3000 mark C_TWO_WINDOWS_2S
